#: ../../api_contracts/README.md:4
msgid ""
"[agent-control-plane.openapi.json](agent-control-plane.openapi.json) is "
"the committed snapshot of the API this service serves. The web client's "
"types and the contract tests are checked against it, so a route or schema"
" change shows up in review as a change to this file."
msgstr "[agent-control-plane.openapi.json](agent-control-plane.openapi.json) 是本服务所提供 API 的已提交快照。Web 客户端的类型和契约测试都以它为准，因此路由或 schema 的改动会在审查中体现为这个文件的变化。"

